ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[x] Surface renders every state from the web source: Loading (skeletons), Loaded (category
    sections + cards), Empty (search-no-match panel + Clear-search). There is deliberately NO
    error/stale/offline state - the web source (WidgetCatalogueDialog.tsx) composes no network
    read (only WIDGET_REGISTRY + useTranslation); fabricating them would violate Covenant #9.
    Documented in WidgetCatalogueState. (Same shape + decision as sibling KeyboardShortcutsModal.)
[x] Hooks bind via the shared P1/S8 state-holder layer: WidgetCatalogueDialogViewModel over the
    IWidgetCatalogue seam (native WIDGET_REGISTRY = 118 widgets, per-category counts asserted
    against the web registry) + the ILocalizer facade. activeWidgetIds is the dialog input;
    onAdd is modeled as the WidgetAddRequested(id) + CloseRequested events. The view performs
    NO data access.
[x] Every i18n key from the web source resolves through the P1/S10 ILocalizer facade and is
    asserted by the key-contract test: translation.dashboard.catalogue.{title,subtitle,
    searchPlaceholder,searchLabel,resultCount,emptyTitle,emptyBody,clearSearch,add,addLabel,
    category.<16>} + translation.dashboard.added. {{added}}/{{total}}/{{count}}/{{name}}
    interpolation mirrors the web (FeedbackModal Replace pattern). No English literal reaches the
    view tree.
[x] Accessibility: Narrator name on the dialog, the search field, each category section heading,
    and every Add button ("Add {name} widget"); the result-count line is a polite live region;
    no bespoke motion (entrance transition gated on MotionPreference.ReduceMotion), no fixed text
    heights so system font scale is honored.
[x] Telemetry: view.opened emitted with surface slug "WidgetCatalogueDialog" on open (P1/S11
    diagnostics contract), PII-safe (slug only - never a widget id or name).
[x] Tests: catalogue integrity (total + 16 per-category counts + unique ids + PUA glyphs) +
    projection (category-ordered grouping, name/description/id + category-label search, trimmed,
    case-insensitive, visible-count, empty) + view-model state matrix (loading/loaded/empty,
    search reset on open+close, active-set -> Added badge/count/subtitle, add->raise+close,
    already-added no-op) + registration/i18n-key contract + interpolation + diagnostics = 49
    facts, all green.
[x] No TODO/FIXME/stub/mock/placeholder/Lorem in shipped code (placeholder gate clean; the single
    allowed match is the verbatim web i18n key).

